<title>USA: Columbia to sell Kerr-McGee natgas.</title>
<headline>Columbia to sell Kerr-McGee natgas.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Columbia Gas System Inc said Thursday that its energy marketing company had agreed to market 250 million cubic feet per day of offshore natural gas produced by Kerr-McGee Corp.</p>
<p>Columbia Gas CEO Oliver Richard said Columbia Energy Services would handle all scheduling, nominating and balancing pipeline transportation activities for Kerr-McGee's offshore natural gas, and would provide financial risk management services.</p>
</text>
